    "title": "MYTVOnline+ IPTV Player",
    "description": "MYTVOnline+ is the easiest way to watch your IPTV streaming sources on-the-go.\r\n\r\nThe best \ud83d\udcaf streaming media viewing client for TVs \ud83d\udcfa is now available on mobile devices \ud83d\udcf1! Take your streaming contents on-the-go with MYTVOnline+.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2705 Stalker, Xtream-Codes API, M3U Playlist support\r\n\u2705 Electronic Program Guide (EPG) through API or xmltv\r\n\u2705 Replay Catch-up playback\r\n\u2705 Favorite and Lock channels\r\n\u2705 Pinned Groups\r\n\u2705 Hide Unwanted categories\r\n\u2705 Parental controls\r\n\u2705 Ultra-stable and fast operation\r\n\u2705 Easy to use\r\n\u2705 Modern interface\r\n\u2705 Rich VOD metadata\r\n\r\nThis app does not provide any streaming contents. You must provide your own IPTV portal or playlist. We do not provide or sell subscription TV, or OTT services. For questions about your IPTV or OTT subscription, credentials, channels, or playlists, please contact your IPTV/OTT service provider. Do not use this app to watch unlicensed contents.",
    "descriptionHTML": "MYTVOnline+ is the easiest way to watch your IPTV streaming sources on-the-go.<br><br>The best \ud83d\udcaf streaming media viewing client for TVs \ud83d\udcfa is now available on mobile devices \ud83d\udcf1! Take your streaming contents on-the-go with MYTVOnline+.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2705 Stalker, Xtream-Codes API, M3U Playlist support<br>\u2705 Electronic Program Guide (EPG) through API or xmltv<br>\u2705 Replay Catch-up playback<br>\u2705 Favorite and Lock channels<br>\u2705 Pinned Groups<br>\u2705 Hide Unwanted categories<br>\u2705 Parental controls<br>\u2705 Ultra-stable and fast operation<br>\u2705 Easy to use<br>\u2705 Modern interface<br>\u2705 Rich VOD metadata<br><br>This app does not provide any streaming contents. You must provide your own IPTV portal or playlist. We do not provide or sell subscription TV, or OTT services. For questions about your IPTV or OTT subscription, credentials, channels, or playlists, please contact your IPTV/OTT service provider. Do not use this app to watch unlicensed contents.",
